{
	"title": "Résoudre cos(2x) = a ou sin(2x) = a sur un intervalle",
	"description": "Changement X = 2x, solutions ±h + kπ (ou h + kπ et π/2 − h + kπ) puis sélection dans ]−π ; π] ou [0 ; 2π[ ; réponse : ensemble fini (pièges : deux solutions au lieu de quatre, 2x oublié, solution hors intervalle)",
	"grades": ["T_SPE"],
	"points": ["TSPE-185"],
	"theme": "Fonctions",
	"domain": "Fonctions trigonométriques",
	"subdomain": "Équations et inéquations",
	"level": 3,
	"status": "draft",
	"delay": 120,
	"shared": {
		"blankDefaults": {
			"answerKind": "intervalles"
		}
	},
	"variations": [
		{
			"statement": "Résous dans $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$ l'équation $\\cos(2x)={{eval:cos(n*pi/6)}}$.\n\nL'ensemble des solutions est $S=?$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "h",
					"expression": "\\frac{\\pi}{12}|\\frac{\\pi}{6}|\\frac{\\pi}{4}|\\frac{\\pi}{3}|\\frac{5\\pi}{12}"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "eval:12*h/\\pi"
				},
				{
					"name": "u",
					"expression": "eval:(12-n)/gcd(12-n,12)"
				},
				{
					"name": "w",
					"expression": "eval:12/gcd(12-n,12)"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "\\{-{{if:u==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{w}} }|\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }}};-{{h}};{{h}};{{if:u==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{w}} }|\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }}}\\}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"On pose $X=2x$ : $\\cos X={{eval:cos(n*pi/6)}}=\\cos\\left(2\\times{{h}}\\right)$, donc $2x=\\pm2\\times{{h}}+2k\\pi$, soit $x=\\pm{{h}}+k\\pi$, $k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$.",
					"Dans $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$ : $x={{h}}$, $x=-{{h}}$, $x={{h}}-\\pi=-{{if:u==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{w}} }|\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }}}$ et $x=-{{h}}+\\pi={{if:u==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{w}} }|\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }}}$.",
					"```trig\npreset: custom\nangles: {{n}}*pi/12, -{{n}}*pi/12, {{eval:12-n}}*pi/12, -{{eval:12-n}}*pi/12\nmode: points\nmesures: principales\n```",
					"$S=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\left\\{-{{if:u==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{w}} }|\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }}}\\,;-{{h}}\\,;{{h}}\\,;{{if:u==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{w}} }|\\frac{ {{u}}\\pi}{ {{w}} }}}\\right\\}}$ : quatre solutions, car $2x$ fait deux tours quand $x$ en fait un."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Résous dans $\\left[0\\,;2\\pi\\right[$ l'équation $\\sin(2x)={{eval:sin(n*pi/6)}}$.\n\nL'ensemble des solutions est $S=?$.",
			"variables": [
				{
					"name": "h",
					"expression": "\\frac{\\pi}{12}|\\frac{\\pi}{6}"
				},
				{
					"name": "n",
					"expression": "eval:12*h/\\pi"
				},
				{
					"name": "p",
					"expression": "eval:(6-n)/gcd(6-n,12)"
				},
				{
					"name": "q",
					"expression": "eval:12/gcd(6-n,12)"
				},
				{
					"name": "r",
					"expression": "eval:(12+n)/gcd(12+n,12)"
				},
				{
					"name": "s",
					"expression": "eval:12/gcd(12+n,12)"
				},
				{
					"name": "t",
					"expression": "eval:(18-n)/gcd(18-n,12)"
				},
				{
					"name": "z",
					"expression": "eval:12/gcd(18-n,12)"
				}
			],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "\\{{{h}};{{if:p==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{q}} }|\\frac{ {{p}}\\pi}{ {{q}} }}};{{if:r==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{s}} }|\\frac{ {{r}}\\pi}{ {{s}} }}};{{if:t==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{z}} }|\\frac{ {{t}}\\pi}{ {{z}} }}}\\}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$\\sin(2x)=\\sin\\left(2\\times{{h}}\\right)$ : $2x=2\\times{{h}}+2k\\pi$ ou $2x=\\pi-2\\times{{h}}+2k\\pi$, soit $x={{h}}+k\\pi$ ou $x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}-{{h}}+k\\pi$.",
					"Dans $\\left[0\\,;2\\pi\\right[$ ($k=0$ ou $k=1$) : ${{h}}$, ${{if:p==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{q}} }|\\frac{ {{p}}\\pi}{ {{q}} }}}$, ${{if:r==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{s}} }|\\frac{ {{r}}\\pi}{ {{s}} }}}$ et ${{if:t==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{z}} }|\\frac{ {{t}}\\pi}{ {{z}} }}}$.",
					"$S=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\left\\{{{h}}\\,;{{if:p==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{q}} }|\\frac{ {{p}}\\pi}{ {{q}} }}}\\,;{{if:r==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{s}} }|\\frac{ {{r}}\\pi}{ {{s}} }}}\\,;{{if:t==1|\\frac{\\pi}{ {{z}} }|\\frac{ {{t}}\\pi}{ {{z}} }}}\\right\\}}$."
				]
			}
		},
		{
			"statement": "Résous dans $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$ l'équation $\\cos(2x)=-1$.\n\nL'ensemble des solutions est $S=?$.",
			"variables": [],
			"blanks": [
				{
					"expectedAnswer": "\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{2};\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\}"
				}
			],
			"correction": {
				"steps": [
					"$\\cos(2x)=-1\\iff2x=\\pi+2k\\pi\\iff x=\\frac{\\pi}{2}+k\\pi$, $k\\in\\mathbb{Z}$.",
					"Dans $\\left]-\\pi\\,;\\pi\\right]$ : $S=\\textcolor{{{color:primary.0}}}{\\left\\{-\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\,;\\frac{\\pi}{2}\\right\\}}$."
				]
			}
		}
	],
